# Agent skills: vendored content, restored by `pnpm skills:install`.
# .agents/skills.json (the manifest) is committed; the skills themselves are not.
# .claude/skills is a symlink to .agents/skills and is committed, so the layout
# is self-evident after a clone -- it resolves once skills:install has run.
.agents/skills/

# Claude Code writes per-session plans here; not part of the repo.
.claude/plans/
